<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <style>
            body {
                font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
                line-height: 1.6;
                color: #333;
            }
            .email-container {
                max-width: 600px;
                margin: 0 auto;
                padding: 20px;
                background-color: #fff;
            }
            .email-header {
                background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b4513 0%, #4a2511 100%);
                color: white;
                padding: 30px 20px;
                text-align: center;
                border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;
            }
            .email-header h2 {
                margin: 0;
                font-size: 28px;
            }
            .email-body {
                padding: 30px 20px;
                border: 1px solid #e0d5c8;
                border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;
            }
            .welcome-message {
                background-color: #f9f6f0;
                padding: 20px;
                border-left: 4px solid #d4af37;
                margin: 20px 0;
                border-radius: 4px;
            }
            .verification-section {
                text-align: center;
                margin: 30px 0;
                padding: 20px 0;
                border-top: 1px solid #e0d5c8;
                border-bottom: 1px solid #e0d5c8;
            }
            .verify-button {
                display: inline-block;
                padding: 15px 40px;
                background-color: #8b4513;
                color: white;
                text-decoration: none;
                border-radius: 5px;
                font-weight: bold;
                font-size: 16px;
                margin: 20px 0;
            }
            .verify-button:hover {
                background-color: #6b3410;
            }
            .code-section {
                background-color: #f5f5f5;
                padding: 15px;
                border-radius: 4px;
                margin: 20px 0;
                word-break: break-all;
                font-family: monospace;
                font-size: 12px;
            }
            .info-box {
                background-color: #fffbf0;
                padding: 15px;
                border-left: 4px solid #d4af37;
                margin: 20px 0;
                border-radius: 4px;
                font-size: 14px;
            }
            .footer {
                text-align: center;
                margin-top: 30px;
                padding-top: 20px;
                border-top: 1px solid #e0d5c8;
                font-size: 12px;
                color: #999;
            }
        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <div class="email-container">
            <div class="email-header">
                <h2>Welcome to Catalbas Bakery!</h2>
            </div>
            
            <div class="email-body">
                <p>Hello <strong>{{ user.username }}</strong>,</p>
                
                <div class="welcome-message">
                    <p>Thank you for registering with <strong>Catalbas Bakery</strong>! We're excited to have you as part of our community.</p>
                </div>

                <p>To complete your registration and unlock all the features of your account, please verify your email address by clicking the button below:</p>

                <div class="verification-section">
                    <a href="{{ verificationUrl }}" class="verify-button">Verify Email Address</a>
                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666;">This link will expire in 24 hours</p>
                </div>

                <p>Or copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
                <div class="code-section">
                    {{ verificationUrl }}
                </div>

                <div class="info-box">
                    <p><strong>⏱️ Link expires in:</strong> 24 hours</p>
                    <p><strong>🔒 Security tip:</strong> Never share this link with anyone. Catalbas Bakery will never ask for this link via email or phone.</p>
                </div>

                <p><strong>After verification, you'll be able to:</strong></p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Access your account and profile</li>
                    <li>View order history</li>
                    <li>Save favorite products</li>
                    <li>Receive exclusive offers and updates</li>
                    <li>Participate in the Bake It Forward program</li>
                </ul>

                <p style="margin-top: 30px;">If you did not create this account, please ignore this email and no further action is needed.</p>

                <p>Best regards,<br><strong>The Catalbas Bakery Team</strong></p>

                <div class="footer">
                    <p>&copy; Catalbas Bakery. All rights reserved.</p>
                    <p>This is an automated email. Please do not reply directly to this message.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </body>
</html>